Text=Phillipe! <He has your arm before he sees who has it, and lets go.> My son. Seven years old, a red cap his mother made him. He was up at the gate with the other boys when the horns went. Everybody who came back came back down this street and he is not among them. If you are going up there -- if you are going anywhere near that gate -- look for a red cap.
